= Midterm Results

The important states: Maine, North Carolina, Texas, Alaska, Iowa, South Carolina

Show students a blank U.S. map with each of the outlines of these states highlighted.

Warm-up: Guess where each of these states are.

Then: list the last years all of these states elected a democrat to the senate.

Try to match the state to the year

